From math import sqrt and ceil

Declare variable x of type integer with value 42

Define function factorial(n of type integer) returning integer:
    If n is less than 2:
        Return 1
    Otherwise:
        Declare variable result of type integer with value 1
        For each i in [1, 2, 3]:
            Multiply result by i
        Return result

Define function process_list(items of type list of integer) returning nothing:
    Declare variable total with value 0
    For each item in items:
        Increase total by item
    Print "Total is:" and total
    Declare variable filtered with value [i times 2 for i in items if i is greater than 5]
    Print "Filtered:" and filtered

Call process_list with [1, 6, 10]
